['Work in Q[u]. A root has multiplicity m when (u−α)^m divides f and the next power does not.','For nonzero f in characteristic zero, its squarefree part is q=f/gcd(f,f′), with monic gcd. A Sturm chain starts q₀=q, q₁=q′ and q_(j+1)=−rem(q_(j−1),q_j). At a real endpoint, delete zero entries before counting sign variations V.'],
